<p>Hello <%= @resource.email %>!</p>

<p>Someone has requested a link to change your password on Caponeu website. You can do this through the link below.</p>

<p><%= link_to 'Click here to change your password', edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %></p>

<p>If you didn't request this, please ignore this email. Your password won't change until you click the link above and create a new password.</p>

<p>Caponeu</p>
